{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-universal-homeomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:62f2e034ce05ca2ca58c25a7bfb2222607a09aab631f18cbcc33b90c7c283197", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is a universal homeomorphism''\nis fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5589d304c66c07b5ff9e5df29dcadaceb0354c3ba9ce02a7ea4c9e05e785186a", "unit_id": "tag:0CEX:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-universally-closed}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-surjective}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-universally-injective}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-universally-open}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bd0c7225e652d9adb5bbc6ddf0db0aa1502e3f1e6d1d6c7e2c97f859176c91ce", "source_text": "This can be proved in exactly the same manner as\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nAlternatively, one can use that\na map of topological spaces is a homeomorphism if and only if\nit is injective, surjective, and open. Thus\na universal homeomorphism is the same thing as a\nsurjective, universally injective, and universally open morphism.\nThus the lemma follows from\nLemmas <REF_0002>,\n<REF_0003>, and\n<REF_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:730f91785eea09c2c6ef64a6fa66abf0b3e266718c842ad8d55e6ddf3d54f510", "unit_id": "tag:0CEX:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-locally-finite-type}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e1013aec367bfe1f130329c82124bf880595c7d52ec2244ca5eeea88aef95dc9", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is locally of finite type''\nis fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e75122a079786b8f2da3d2079125a47b423beb08d432c41c65aa7a3107c5b911", "unit_id": "tag:02KX:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S' \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$f' : X' \\to S'$", "MATH_0004": "$U \\subset X$", "MATH_0005": "$U' = S' \\times_S U$", "MATH_0006": "$S'$", "MATH_0007": "$S = \\Spec(R)$", "MATH_0008": "$S' = \\Spec(R')$", "MATH_0009": "$U = \\Spec(A)$", "MATH_0010": "$U' = \\Spec(A')$", "MATH_0011": "$R \\to R'$", "MATH_0012": "$A' = R' \\otimes_R A$", "MATH_0013": "$R' \\to A'$", "MATH_0014": "$R \\to A$", "MATH_0015": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-base-change-finite-type}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-locally-finite-type-characterize}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-finite-type-descends}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-descending-properties-morphisms}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a08322e940d87b836848bb7291d3e19259fcd2a4c8cfff0659ae8b347cd94001", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7b1380b4dd1de9063eae45404807a737c1cfafdf0a24190ab1aead5c59654180", "source_text": "Being locally of finite type is preserved under base change, see\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nBeing locally of finite type is Zariski local on the base, see\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nFinally, let\n<MATH_0001> be a flat surjective morphism of affine schemes,\nand let <MATH_0002> be a morphism. Assume that the base change\n<MATH_0003> is locally of finite type.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an affine open. Then <MATH_0005>\nis affine and of finite type over <MATH_0006>. Write\n<MATH_0007>,\n<MATH_0008>,\n<MATH_0009>, and\n<MATH_0010>.\nWe know that <MATH_0011> is faithfully flat,\n<MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013> is of finite type.\nWe have to show that <MATH_0014> is of finite type.\nThis is the result of\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nIt follows that <MATH_0015> is locally of finite type.\nTherefore Lemma <REF_0004> applies and we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3ed1839ad1008b8e84db28830e467f67b45923e1fe4d4385ec5eada9b01543f7", "unit_id": "tag:02KX:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-locally-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6f08fc2c10b6141d6cd108df87f86a4e2079f2b14f3fa99e5d25af98311a62e7", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is locally of finite presentation''\nis fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5838ec0f57e63d4450e6fb1a404a032245267a92d147a4365889b331da8b759d", "unit_id": "tag:02KY:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S' \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$f' : X' \\to S'$", "MATH_0004": "$U \\subset X$", "MATH_0005": "$U' = S' \\times_S U$", "MATH_0006": "$S'$", "MATH_0007": "$S = \\Spec(R)$", "MATH_0008": "$S' = \\Spec(R')$", "MATH_0009": "$U = \\Spec(A)$", "MATH_0010": "$U' = \\Spec(A')$", "MATH_0011": "$R \\to R'$", "MATH_0012": "$A' = R' \\otimes_R A$", "MATH_0013": "$R' \\to A'$", "MATH_0014": "$R \\to A$", "MATH_0015": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-base-change-finite-presentation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-locally-finite-presentation-characterize}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-finite-presentation-descends}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-descending-properties-morphisms}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a08322e940d87b836848bb7291d3e19259fcd2a4c8cfff0659ae8b347cd94001", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b6efceb07342ec7f1bbcd6a36e5a7ad52928f35f6c6ea31ed72cf4c362166806", "source_text": "Being locally of finite presentation is preserved under base change, see\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nBeing locally of finite type is Zariski local on the base, see Morphisms,\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nFinally, let\n<MATH_0001> be a flat surjective morphism of affine schemes,\nand let <MATH_0002> be a morphism. Assume that the base change\n<MATH_0003> is locally of finite presentation.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an affine open. Then <MATH_0005>\nis affine and of finite type over <MATH_0006>. Write\n<MATH_0007>,\n<MATH_0008>,\n<MATH_0009>, and\n<MATH_0010>.\nWe know that <MATH_0011> is faithfully flat,\n<MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013> is of finite presentation.\nWe have to show that <MATH_0014> is of finite presentation.\nThis is the result of\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nIt follows that <MATH_0015> is locally of finite presentation.\nTherefore Lemma <REF_0004> applies and we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c2498a614d018ab6f0c8ca26b6de55bd11e9142b977d9448e874c02d15d8a14a", "unit_id": "tag:02KY:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-finite-type}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9806cc292356a99d79dc8278908e3220f009b74c4ed2a03937d89fffb1873624", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is of finite type''\nis fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1207318eab906562b534e3fb3f03bffaf79ed702d7beed8ebc05d704a05e87d4", "unit_id": "tag:02KZ:statement"}
